  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/types-contacts-api (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases/download/bun-v1.3.13/ and then executes a 727KB heavily-obfuscated payload (math_init.js) at install time. The package is published as a TypeScript types package (pure.d.ts declarations) and has no legitimate need to run arbitrary code during installation. The payload uses a custom string-array obfuscation scheme that defeats static analysis and conceals its behaviour.",
